Third-party material in this repository

- assets/MaterialSymbols-subset.ttf: a subset of Google's Material Symbols,
  licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- assets/fonts/*: Amiri Quran, Charis SIL, Literata, Noto Naskh Arabic and
  Noto Serif, each under the SIL Open Font License; the licence texts are the
  OFL-*.txt files next to the fonts.
- ereader/qrcodegen.py: Nayuki's QR Code generator library, MIT licence
  (see the header of that file).
- The Waveshare e-paper driver is not included. See the README for how to
  install it into lib/waveshare_epd.
